---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog
description: Thoughts on building, learning, and engineering.
permalink: /blog/
---

<article id="main">
  <header>
    <h2>Blog</h2>
    <p>Thoughts on building, learning, and engineering.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="wrapper style5">
    <div class="inner">
      <ul class="post-list post-list-page">
        {% for post in collections.posts %}
        <li>
          <span class="post-list-date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
          <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        </li>
        {% else %}
        <li><p>No posts yet. Check back soon.</p></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>
